WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.493 --> 00:00:08.717
Thump! "Oof!"

2
00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:20.527
Perda cried out as she, Zann, and Zing fell back onto the ground just outside the wall.

3
00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:25.551
Shield spell!"

4
00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:27.953
Zann rubbed his shoulder where he'd bumped it.

5
00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:30.034
"It felt like a strong one too."

6
00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:31.696
Perda frowned.

7
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.862
"Zira saw me create the Shield spell to stop the gorzogs.

8
00:00:36.642 --> 00:00:39.004
She must have figured out how to do one herself."

9
00:00:39.864 --> 00:00:40.985
Mellis hurried forward.

10
00:00:41.005 --> 00:00:42.546
"Are you okay?"

11
00:00:43.026 --> 00:00:43.526
she asked.

12
00:00:44.027 --> 00:00:44.767
"What happened?"

13
00:00:45.828 --> 00:00:47.709
Perda and Zann quickly explained.

14
00:00:47.729 --> 00:00:50.690
"But why would she want to shield the well?"

15
00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:51.691
Zann said.

16
00:00:51.711 --> 00:00:56.313
"She wants to control the source of magic," Perda said grimly.

17
00:00:56.333 --> 00:01:00.836
"This makes me worry that Mellis isn't going to be safe here without us."

18
00:01:01.756 --> 00:01:02.556
Zann shrugged.

19
00:01:02.576 --> 00:01:04.457
"So let's take her back to Magica."

20
00:01:04.477 --> 00:01:07.658
"That's exactly what I was thinking," Perda said.

21
00:01:07.678 --> 00:01:09.338
"What do you say, Mellis?

22
00:01:09.898 --> 00:01:13.059
You can practice your magic even more easily in Magica.

23
00:01:13.979 --> 00:01:17.940
We can tell Zann's parents and grandfather what's going on here and ask them to help."

24
00:01:19.221 --> 00:01:21.221
Mellis didn't say anything for a moment.

25
00:01:21.842 --> 00:01:23.222
She appeared to be thinking.

26
00:01:23.242 --> 00:01:25.563
"Thank you," she said at last.

27
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:28.083
"I'd love to see your world.

28
00:01:28.883 --> 00:01:34.175
But Terrica is my home, and if it's in trouble, I need to stay and try to help."

29
00:01:34.195 --> 00:01:36.757
"I understand," Zann said.

30
00:01:36.777 --> 00:01:40.940
"Anyway, none of us can go anywhere until we figure out a way past that Shield spell."

31
00:01:41.621 --> 00:01:43.302
Perda realized he was right.

32
00:01:43.322 --> 00:01:47.346
"Let's levitate up and look into the well from above," she said.

33
00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:51.469
"Maybe the shield goes only as high as the wall does."

34
00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:54.912
Mellis looked around at the crowds of people.

35
00:01:54.932 --> 00:01:58.415
"Are you sure we should levitate where people can see?"

36
00:01:58.875 --> 00:01:59.376
she asked.

37
00:02:00.016 --> 00:02:02.197
"Surely Zira will hear about it if we do."

38
00:02:02.217 --> 00:02:03.538
"Good point."

39
00:02:04.258 --> 00:02:08.441
Zann squinted up at the tree, which Perda noticed had grown even larger.

40
00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:11.002
"A few branches are sticking out over the wall.

41
00:02:11.682 --> 00:02:13.383
We could try to grab them and climb up that way."

42
00:02:17.445 --> 00:02:21.588
Zing helped by flying up and perching on a branch to make it sink lower.

43
00:02:23.509 --> 00:02:25.990
Then Perda climbed onto Zann's shoulders.

44
00:02:27.051 --> 00:02:29.472
That lifted her high enough to grab the branch.

45
00:02:30.256 --> 00:02:33.898
Soon all three kids were scrambling up toward the center of the tree.

46
00:02:34.678 --> 00:02:37.279
The shield stopped them before they reached the trunk.

47
00:02:37.919 --> 00:02:39.660
But they could look down over the wall.

48
00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.241
Perda gasped when she saw the well.

49
00:02:42.261 --> 00:02:45.082
"The water is clear now," she said.

50
00:02:45.102 --> 00:02:48.964
"I wonder if that means most of the magic energy has escaped."

51
00:02:48.984 --> 00:02:51.325
"Maybe," Zann said.

52
00:02:51.345 --> 00:02:54.306
"Look! You can see to the bottom of the well.

53
00:02:54.827 --> 00:02:57.848
It looks like lots of roots have grown out over the bottom!"

54
00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:02.361
They all stared down at the tangled mass of large roots.

55
00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:04.202
Did they belong to the tree?

56
00:03:04.742 --> 00:03:08.983
Before Perda could figure it out, Krub and Zira zapped into view below.

57
00:03:09.563 --> 00:03:10.604
Vilkor was with them.

58
00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.264
He looked sulky.

59
00:03:12.864 --> 00:03:16.585
Perda also spotted three muscular men she'd never seen before.

60
00:03:16.605 --> 00:03:21.227
"Attention!" Zira shouted, glaring around at the crowd.

61
00:03:21.827 --> 00:03:25.108
"You all must leave this area immediately."

62
00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:29.286
Nobody paid any more attention to her than they had to Mellis.

63
00:03:29.966 --> 00:03:32.928
Zira waited a moment, tapping a foot impatiently.

64
00:03:33.608 --> 00:03:35.369
Then she snapped her fingers.

65
00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:40.412
A tall wall of fire sprang up, surrounding the entire crowd.

66
00:03:41.172 --> 00:03:44.234
People screamed and shouted, coughing from the smoke.

67
00:03:44.894 --> 00:03:50.237
The flames crept inward, trapping everyone in a smaller and smaller area.

68
00:03:50.257 --> 00:03:51.718
"Oh, no!"

69
00:03:52.178 --> 00:03:53.059
Perda exclaimed.

70
00:03:53.079 --> 00:03:54.660
"We have to stop her!"

71
00:03:56.144 --> 00:03:57.886
Zann glanced into the well.

72
00:03:57.906 --> 00:04:00.468
"Let's use this water to douse the flames."

73
00:04:01.228 --> 00:04:02.309
"How can we do that?"

74
00:04:02.769 --> 00:04:03.430
Mellis cried.

75
00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:05.451
"It's behind the Shield spell!"

76
00:04:05.471 --> 00:04:10.355
"Most Shield spells work in only one direction," Perda explained.

77
00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:14.098
"They're usually meant to keep people out, not in."

78
00:04:14.939 --> 00:04:15.679
Zann nodded.

79
00:04:15.699 --> 00:04:18.762
"A two-way shield is much more difficult to create.

80
00:04:19.402 --> 00:04:21.664
Let's hope Zira hasn't figured out how to do that yet."

81
00:04:22.644 --> 00:04:26.125
They all rubbed their hands together and focused on the well water.

82
00:04:26.845 --> 00:04:28.746
It rose up and out of the hole.

83
00:04:29.506 --> 00:04:34.527
For a second Perda was afraid they might send it flying into the sky, like Mellis had done

84
00:04:34.567 --> 00:04:35.407
with the pond water.

85
00:04:35.427 --> 00:04:38.168
"Easy, easy," she said.

86
00:04:38.188 --> 00:04:41.149
"Focus on keeping it where we want it."

87
00:04:41.989 --> 00:04:45.070
Mellis and Zann nodded, their expressions focused.

88
00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:49.271
Perda held her breath until the water broke through the shield.

89
00:04:49.291 --> 00:04:53.369
"It is one-way only," she said in relief.

90
00:04:54.029 --> 00:04:59.733
"Now follow my count of three—one, two, three, go!"

91
00:05:00.674 --> 00:05:03.796
They magically flung the water onto the ring of flames.

92
00:05:04.256 --> 00:05:08.379
Whoosh! The people were soaked, but the fire went out.

93
00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.100
Everyone ran away.

94
00:05:10.741 --> 00:05:12.102
Perda slumped with relief.

95
00:05:12.662 --> 00:05:14.483
Then Zira spotted them.

96
00:05:14.503 --> 00:05:17.565
"Come down here," Zira ordered.

97
00:05:18.226 --> 00:05:20.988
"Now!" Mellis looked nervous.

98
00:05:21.752 --> 00:05:23.573
But Perda wasn't scared of Zira.

99
00:05:23.593 --> 00:05:28.017
"Zira is an adult, and she's a fast learner," Perda thought.

100
00:05:28.037 --> 00:05:31.519
"But Zann and I have much more experience with magic."

101
00:05:31.539 --> 00:05:34.541
"Come on, Zing," Zann said, whistling.

102
00:05:35.162 --> 00:05:38.504
The little dragon stayed where he was, hidden in the branches.

103
00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:39.845
Zann shrugged.

104
00:05:40.425 --> 00:05:43.007
"Suit yourself," he said with a touch of annoyance.

105
00:05:43.027 --> 00:05:46.010
"Let's levitate down," Perda whispered.

106
00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:49.232
"Maybe that will make her realize who she's messing with."

107
00:05:50.796 --> 00:05:53.318
They floated down, landing in front of Zira.

108
00:05:53.338 --> 00:05:56.461
"We're glad you're here," Zann said boldly.

109
00:05:56.481 --> 00:05:58.903
"You're the one who wants us to leave Terrica, right?

110
00:05:59.383 --> 00:06:01.685
We can't do that while your Shield spell is blocking the wormhole."

111
00:06:01.705 --> 00:06:06.789
"Actually, I've changed my mind about you leaving," Zira said.

112
00:06:06.809 --> 00:06:11.193
"I've learned a lot of magic by spying on you two.

113
00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:15.076
And you might have still more to teach me."

114
00:06:15.836 --> 00:06:18.478
She rubbed her fingers together and then pointed at them.

115
00:06:18.499 --> 00:06:25.061
"Shackle!" Magical arm and leg shackles appeared on Zann, Perda, and Mellis.

116
00:06:25.881 --> 00:06:27.802
Their hands were bound behind their backs.

117
00:06:30.263 --> 00:06:31.863
"Stop!" Perda cried.

118
00:06:31.883 --> 00:06:33.724
"You can't do this!"

119
00:06:34.724 --> 00:06:35.604
Zira smirked.

120
00:06:35.624 --> 00:06:37.425
"Yes, I can.

121
00:06:38.205 --> 00:06:39.845
I'd like to keep you around.

122
00:06:40.546 --> 00:06:44.087
But you three are too much trouble when you're together."

123
00:06:45.127 --> 00:06:47.508
She gestured to Krub and two of the other men.

124
00:06:47.528 --> 00:06:52.817
"Take them away—to three separate far-flung corners of
